CP360 / CONSTRUCTIONPROGRESS360 PRODUCT CONTEXT
====================================================

Product:
CP360 / ConstructionProgress360

Company/Product context:
CP360 is a CONVAZANT product. DECKARC LLC is one customer/workspace, not the hardcoded product brand.

Core positioning:
CP360 is the daily operations command center that removes the owner as the bottleneck between the field and the homeowner.

Core wedge:
Turn today’s chaos into tomorrow’s plan.

Primary ICP:
Owner-led remodelers and addition contractors managing 3–15 active projects.

